</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique backgrounds that use a blend of pixel art and algorithmic art (no\u00a0AI-generated stuff !)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic interactions between characters, based around dilemmas\u00a0and\u00a0responsibilities, as\u00a0well as\u00a0a\u00a0tinge\u00a0of\u00a0attraction.</p></li></ul>",
